sequenceDiagram
 actor User as Владелец
 participant Frontend
 participant API as Backend/API
 participant Auth as Auth/ACL
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 User->>Frontend: Запустить выбранный маршрут
 Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/documents/{doc_id}/workflows
 Note over Frontend,API: JSON template_id, expected_revision, idempotency_key
 API->>Auth: Cookie ACTIVE CSRF Origin, owner
 Auth->>DB: Session/user, card visibility
 API->>DB: Advisory key lock и document FOR UPDATE
 alt Replay
  API->>DB: WorkflowEvent и прежний instance
  API-->>Frontend: 201 прежний instance representation
 else Новая операция
  API->>DB: revision, current version, FileScan, template, type requirement
  alt Wrong revision / route / file
   API-->>Frontend: 409 stale_document / required_workflow / file_required либо 503 file_scan_required
  else Проверки выполнены
   API->>DB: Resolve ACTIVE targets, исключить owner, сохранить snapshot и plan
   API->>DB: INSERT instance и approvals, UPDATE IN_APPROVAL, audit/event, COMMIT
   API-->>Frontend: 201 instance_data
  end
 end
 Note over API,DB: Start проверяет attestation, не вызывает ClamAV заново
